# =====================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
*.egg-info/

